= Establishment of the Western Hills Group

In the aftermath of Hu Hanmin's exile, Lin Sen has organized the Western Hills Group in Beijing.

The Western Hills group is a right, anti-communist, conservative faction within the Kuomintang. Members include Lin Sen and Dai Jitao.

Due to the ongoing power struggle, the Western Hills have given their support to Chiang Kai-shek.
